%% Spid3r Store — authentication & RBAC flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant DB as Database
    participant MW as role:/permission: middleware

    U->>AC: POST /register (throttle:5,60)
    AC->>AS: register() — bcrypt hash via framework/Auth/Hash
    AS->>DB: users row + customer role
    U->>AC: POST /login (throttle:5,60)
    AC->>AS: login() — verify hash, create session (sess_ token)
    AS-->>U: Set-Cookie spid3r_session (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Secure opt-in)
    U->>MW: GET /admin (role:admin)
    MW->>DB: AccessPolicy.is_admin(user_id) via user_roles
    alt authorized
        MW->>MW: next(req)
    else not authorized
        MW-->>U: 401 / 403 (unauthorized()/forbidden())
    end
    Note over AS,DB: CSRF: every state-changing POST/PUT/DELETE requires _csrf (419 on mismatch)
